# Prisma Schema Conventions

## IDs & timestamps

- String IDs: `@id @default(uuid())`
- Every model: `createdAt DateTime @default(now())` + `updatedAt DateTime @updatedAt`

## Relations

- Define both sides with `@relation`
- Name foreign keys explicitly: `companyId String` + `company Company @relation(...)`

## Indexes

Add `@@index` on fields used in filters:
- `Ticket`: status, companyId, systemId, creatorId
- `User`: email, role, companyId

## Enums

Keep enums in sync across:
1. `schema.prisma`
2. `frontend/src/lib/constants.ts` (labels)
3. Backend DTOs

Existing enums: `UserRole`, `TicketStatus`, `TicketType`, `Priority`, `CommentVisibility`, `NotificationType`.

## Migrations

```bash
cd backend
npx prisma migrate dev --name descriptive_name
npx prisma generate
```

Never edit applied migration SQL manually unless resolving conflicts.
